  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Thinly slice carrot into sticks. Thinly slice cucumber into rounds.\n• Cut plain tofu (see ingredients) into 2cm chunks.\n• In a small bowl, combine sriracha, sesame dressing and the soy sauce.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, crack the eggs into the pan. Cook until egg whites are firm and yolks are cooked to your liking, 4-5 minutes. Season with salt and pepper and transfer to a plate. Cover to keep warm.\n• TIP: Sriracha is slightly spicy, use less if you're sensitive to heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834015ad9848b9dac04a303/step-cc31d700.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the eggs are frying, add carrot and a splash of water to a microwave-safe bowl, then cover with a damp paper towel.\n• Microwave carrot on high until just tender, 2-3 minutes.\n• Drain carrot, then return to the bowl. Add baby spinach leaves, shredded cabbage mix and a drizzle of white wine vinegar, toss to coat. Season to taste and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834015ad9848b9dac04a303/step-d1319d10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Microwave basmati rice until steaming, 2-3 minutes.\n• Meanwhile, return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When the oil is hot, cook tofu, turning occasionally, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add sweet soy seasoning and cook, turning to coat, until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834015ad9848b9dac04a303/step-ce67fd20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice, veggies, radish and Korean tofu between bowls.\n• Top with a fried egg and drizzle over sriracha dressing.\n• Garnish with sesame seeds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6834015ad9848b9dac04a303/step-3841de30.jpg"
    }
  ]
